  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "wslua: Fix Coverity MISSING_LOCK for debugger shared state",
  "description": "Guard reads of debugger.enabled (and reload-related fields in\nwslua_debugger_notify_reload) with debugger.mutex so they match writes.\nAvoid holding the mutex while calling wslua_debugger_set_enabled to\nprevent deadlock. In the Lua line hook, snapshot enabled under the lock\nbut keep the mutex released across lua_getinfo, breakpoint checks, and\nthe nested UI callback.\n\nCoverity CID 1692284, 1692285, 1692286, 1692287\n\nFix #21230\n\nAI-Assisted: yes",
